WEBVTT

c1
00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:19.309
<v spk_0>This blade has a dark past.

c2
00:00:21.409 --> 00:00:24.069
<v spk_0>It has shed much innocent blood.

c3
00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:30.370
<v spk_0>You're a fool for traveling alone,
so completely unprepared.

c4
00:00:31.329 --> 00:00:32.970
<v spk_0>You're lucky your blood's still flowing.

c5
00:00:35.020 --> 00:00:36.020
<v spk_0>Thank you.

c6
00:00:37.029 --> 00:00:41.430
<v spk_0>So, What brings you to the land of the
gatekeepers?

c7
00:00:43.150 --> 00:00:46.380
<v spk_1>Um I'm searching for someone.

c8
00:00:47.630 --> 00:00:48.770
<v spk_0>Someone very dear.

c9
00:00:49.729 --> 00:00:50.729
<v spk_0>A kindred spirit.

c10
00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:54.150
<v spk_1>A dragon.

c11
00:00:58.759 --> 00:00:59.880
<v spk_1>A dangerous quest.
